      "translation": {
        "english_text": "The poison is with me—the cunning is with you. That beggar Kumaran must become a corpse. Careful! Conspiracy is a kind of magic trick! You're the right woman for it! I'm leaving town urgently today. Before I return tonight, fire must be spreading over that dog's corpse.",
